{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1545060-mtaw-2e-spells-as-tattoos","id":1545060,"title":"[MtAw 2E] Spells as Tattoos","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-30T11:57:20-07:00","id":1545060,"title":"[MtAw 2E] Spells as Tattoos","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">My player is thinking about making classical character <i>\u2018I cast magic by/from tattoos on my body\u2019</i>. But how that would work in <b>Mage 2E</b>? Character makes Runes on his body \u2013 and then what? Spell just stays active on whole time being on body? Character need to add Fate 2 and activation trigger \u2013 like \u2018erase particular tattoo\u2019? Or maybe whole thing should work like<b><i> Basilisk</i></b> Yantra from <b>Signs of Sorcery</b> \u2013 basically, magical painting? <span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI Emoji\">\ud83e\udd14</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Or rather ready-made yantra tattooed on the body which is adding just at this instance cast specific spell gives +2 as a yantra, and it is a free action yantra because you already have these runes ready on you.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Example:</b> Let\u2019s say Thyrsus is making as tattoo <b><i>Knit</i></b> Life 3 spell. Will it be \u2018turn on\u2019 all the time ink is on the target? Will just Thyrsus can use prepared before Runes on his body, touching them \u2013 bust each time casting separately? Will <b><i>Knit</i></b> heal Thyrsus each Ritual Casting Interval until erased from body?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">How do you see this examples, people?</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T12:24:43-07:00","id":1545061,"title":"","content":"Do they wish to focus on a few Imbuements to always have ready as tattoos or do they wish to switch them around ? Do they instead wish to just use the tattoos as yantras ? It all depends on the approach they wish to focus on. For example, if they want to distribute magical art to others, they could imbue a tattoo stencil instead, with the item casting the spell on anyone its used to apply the tattoo on. In this way, provided they have enough mana, they can affect as many targets as needed while only using one spell slot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.